# Bargain (CR 702.166) and the second sentence: Entomb buries Memnite (mana value 0) and Serra Angel (5). Back for Seconds, bargained
# by sacrificing Mox Emerald, targets both; only Memnite may go onto the battlefield (Serra Angel is refused), so it does and Serra
# Angel goes to the hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Entomb
Entomb
Back for Seconds
Memnite
Serra Angel
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Memnite)
